BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Discovery Fest
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260810
UID:10002099-1785542400-1786319999@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Downtown Discovery Fest is taking over Downtown Davis August 1
 –9 with a week of family-friendly fun\, local experiences\, and communit
 y celebration! \nExplore the Farmers Market 50th Birthday Bash\, search fo
 r hidden Golden Tickets\, sip your way through the Coffee Trail\, and wrap
  up the week by supporting your favorite local businesses during Shop Smal
 l Weekend. \nWhether you’re shopping\, dining\, or discovering something
  new\, there’s something for everyone. Gather your friends and family an
 d come celebrate everything that makes Downtown Davis special!
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/22460/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Davis Farmers Market - Every Saturday from 8am - 1pm
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T010000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T060000
UID:10001837-1785571200-1785589200@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Experience the heart and soul of Davis every Saturday at the 
 Davis Farmers Market in Central Park! \n🗓 Every Saturday⏰ 8:00 AM 
 – 1:00 PM📍 Central Park\, Davis \nShop fresh from the source with lo
 cal farmers and vendors offering: \n🥕 Fresh\, seasonal produce🌻 Farm
  products🛍 Handmade crafts🥖 Fresh-baked goods☕ Coffee and hot food
  \nWhether you’re stocking up on locally grown ingredients\, enjoying br
 eakfast in the park\, or simply soaking in the vibrant community atmospher
 e\, the Davis Farmers Market is a beloved weekly tradition for all ages. \
 nBring your family\, support local growers and makers\, and enjoy the boun
 ty of our fertile region every Saturday!
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-every-saturday-fr
 om-8am-1pm/2026-08-01/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Picnic in the Park at Davis Farmers Market – Wednesday Evenings 
 (50th Anniversary Year)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T200000
UID:10000887-1785945600-1785960000@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The beloved Picnic in the Park season is back at the Davis Far
 mers Market starting Wednesday\, April 1\, 2026! \nEvery Wednesday evening
  through August 26\, the market expands to 4:00 – 8:00 PM\, turning Cent
 ral Park into the perfect spot for a relaxed picnic dinner. Shop fresh pro
 duce\, artisan goods\, and a wide variety of prepared foods from your favo
 rite vendors. Enjoy local craft beer\, wine\, and brand new this year – 
 mead! \nEach week features live music and children’s activities\, creati
 ng a festive\, family-friendly atmosphere. Bring blankets\, lawn chairs\, 
 and reusable bags. It’s the ideal way to unwind\, connect with neighbors
 \, and support local farmers and food makers. \nThis year is extra special
  as the Davis Farmers Market celebrates its 50th Anniversary! Don’t miss
  the big anniversary celebration on Saturday\, August 1\, 2026. \nNew in 2
 026: The Market Memories Cookbook (presale now at davis-farmers-market). \
 nHighlights Include: \n\nBuckhorn Food Truck\, The Hotdogger\, Dhillon Far
 m\, Davis Bread & Desserts\, Greek Table\, Kettle Pop & more\nLive music e
 very week\nKids’ activities\nLocal beer\, wine & mead\n\nFree to attend 
 – everyone is welcome!
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-
 local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-08-05/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
