BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Davis Downtown Board Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T020000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T030000
UID:10000018-1786611600-1786615200@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the second Thursday of each month for our Governing
  Board of Directors meeting. The meeting is open to all interested. Stay u
 p-to-date on business and initiatives related to downtown Davis\, and the 
 opportunity to provide public comment will be available. \nMeetings are cu
 rrently held virtually on the Zoom platform from 9:00am to 10:00am. If you
  are interested in attending\, please contact us at info@davisdowntown.com
  to request a Zoom meeting invitation. \nTo view\, download and/or print B
 oard of Directors meeting agendas or minutes\, click on the following link
 : https://davisdowntown.com/agendas-meeting-information. \nMeeting locatio
 ns and times are subject to change.
LOCATION:Davis Downtown Board Meeting\, Zoom\, Davis\, CA
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-downtown-board-meeting/2026-08-1
 3/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bistro Nights at Upper Crust Baking Co.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260814T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260814T210000
UID:10001139-1786723200-1786741200@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Unwind your Fridays with Bistro Night at Upper Crust Baking C
 o.\, happening weekly all summer and fall! \n🗓 Every Friday (Starting 
 April 24)⏰ 4:00 PM – 9:00 PM📍 Upper Crust Patio \nEnjoy a relaxin
 g evening featuring:• Charcuterie boards• Cheese boards• Pâté boar
 ds• Local beer & wine \nGrab some friends\, sip\, snack\, and enjoy a pe
 rfect patio night 🍷🧀
LOCATION:Upper Crust\, 634 G St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/bistro-nights-at-upper-crust-baking-co
 /2026-08-14/
